    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Warpbane Task Force",
    "summary": "Hallowed Ground always includes your own deployment zone. At each phase start, check No Man’s Land and the enemy deployment zone separately. Add a region for that phase if your share of its controlled objectives reaches one half or more. The area within 6″ of friendly PURIFIER SQUAD units is also Hallowed Ground. Your GREY KNIGHTS re-roll Hit rolls of 1 on melee attacks or on ranged attacks against visible targets. For PURIFIER SQUAD units or units wholly in Hallowed Ground, any Hit roll on those attacks can be re-rolled instead.",
